  "description": "ACCDB: Cross-engine same-page conflict error codes (3188 vs 3197 vs 3218 / 0x80040E21): (1) DAO uncommitted BeginTrans on T row 1 -> ADO UPDATE row 1, ADO UPDATE row 2 (same page), ADO server keyset edit row 2 Update, and ADO UPDATE T2 row 1 (admitted control); then DAO Rollback. (2) ADO uncommitted BeginTrans on T row 1 -> DAO Execute UPDATE row 1, DAO Execute UPDATE row 2 (same page), DAO pessimistic dynaset Edit row 2, DAO optimistic dynaset Edit+Update row 1; then ADO CommitTrans and DAO optimistic retry (3197). Keeps all pages before/after each phase and close.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
